  "description": "CR 406.6 / 607.2a / 611.2e / 613.4b / 122.1b / 602.5d: Ghost Vacuum exiles cards from a graveyard, then at sorcery speed puts each creature card it exiled onto the battlefield under its controller's control as a 1/1 Spirit with a flying counter",
  "note": "The Vacuum exiles bob's Glorious Anthem on turn 1 and his Hill Giant on turn 3. On turn 5 the sacrifice ability is refused in combat; after combat it brings back the Giant under alice's control, a 1/1 Giant Spirit with a flying counter, while the Anthem (not a creature card) and the Grizzly Bears bob had in exile before (not exiled with the Vacuum) stay in exile. Alice's Divination in her graveyard keeps a second target on offer on turn 3.",
